		(uuid "68079b1d-acbb-41c4-bd29-27e38084b6bb")
	)
	(text "Configuration 3: CFG_STRAP1 10k; CFG_STRAP2/3, NON_REM and BC_EN 200k pull-downs.\nInternal ROM boot; all ports removable; battery charging detection off.\nHUB_SCL/SDA stay low during reset for autonomous attachment.\nRESET_N = AON_RESET_N AND HUB_RUN; HUB_RUN has a pull-up.\nThe external host reaches the hub directly through the upstream orientation mux.\nHUB_UP_VBUS is a hardware divider from host VBUS; MCU firmware is not needed to enumerate.\nPort 6 USB2 connects the RP2354. Target power is controlled independently of PRT_CTL1-6.\nUpstream TX uses C222/C223; downstream TX coupling is on the repeated port sheets.\nSuperSpeed lanes support native rate negotiation; USB2 D+/D- are never polarity swapped."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c90acd91-f0ac-42bd-8f98-a780db8b7cc3")
	)
